**********  errors and other found shit...high priority

(u)int8 types use null ('\000') in place of 0
  this causes problems with c-style strings, which i use extensively in saving thru stringstream and it's insertion op (<<)
  to fix this, as there are very few cases it's required, cast the int8 data to int16 before insertion
  there are ~1600 uses of (u)int8 in current code; around 20 of them are saved 

